<title>POLAND: FARMFOOD SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>FARMFOOD SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.98 vs   0.66</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.38 vs   0.66</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.27 vs   1.92</p>
<p> Sales		   18.77 vs  14.14</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.26 vs   9.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.32 vs   9.18</p>
<p> Operating profit    16.80 vs  13.63</p>
<p> Sales		  149.50 vs 110.95</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food producer is FarmFood SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
